    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d765">

                <pb facs="0802" n="752" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg752"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Department of
                                State</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1894-01-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 4,
                    1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In an interview with the minister of Turkey to-day he assured me positively that
                    the Turkish Government has not made and will not make arrests except so far as
                    necessary to effect deportation. If imprisonments occur otherwise you will
                    insist on fulfillment of this promise.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
